Submit Result
The results that the contestants need to submit are divided into three parts, which are stored in the corresponding folders. For Task 1 and Task 2, participants submit the probability graphs of model predictions, with file names consistent with the corresponding fundus color photos and in PNG format. The RGB channels of the probability graphs correspond to arteries, all blood vessels, and veins respectively. For Task 3, participants submit text files containing the results of various vascular biomarker indicators, with file names consistent with the corresponding fundus color photos and in TXT format. All result folders of the three tasks are stored in a folder named after the team ID, compressed and submitted to the provided submission entry.
Submit Example
We have provided an example of submission, and the format, composition, and naming format of your final submission should be the same as the example.

